# This public portfolio repository intentionally tracks source code and documents only.
*
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!README.md
!Docs/
!Docs/**/
!Docs/**/*.md
!Assets/
!Assets/Scripts/
!Assets/Scripts/**/
!Assets/Scripts/**/*.cs
!Assets/Editor/
!Assets/Editor/**/
!Assets/Editor/**/*.cs
!Assets/Shaders/
!Assets/Shaders/**/
!Assets/Shaders/**/*.shader
